  "scope": "G08 live co-op temporary roles, separate waiting/current inventories, original stat/item transfers and legacy/reconnect handling. Focused gameplay validation only.",
  "network_protocol": 11,
  "contract": [
    "Captivity, Nalo, Jun disguise and Shaina apply their original temporary body/equipment rules to guests, including visiting or disconnected saved guests. Ordinary LiA permanent chapter changes retain live guest heroes.",
    "Each guest parks their own normal hero and purse. Captivity copies their own stats; Nalo and Shaina start with stock role abilities; Jun copies their own stats/equipment. Normal records return through the original operations.",
    "Temporary class-only guests receive an empty private bag without cloning the shared host inventory. Only loot transferred by original party operations returns to the shared bag; Nalo/Shaina-only bags remain parked.",
    "Nested host/guest rewards and campaign party switches resume the correct current purse even when class guests enter or leave temporary private inventory.",
    "Live role restrictions are independent of quest-credit eligibility. Eligible standalone guest saves retain the guest's played temporary role and private loot; uncredited travel cannot advance the saved checkpoint.",
    "Extra actor deployment names are unique and link on both peers; native narrative Hero/Nalo/Shaina remains host-controlled. Network display names, including ::, do not override original CopyStats references.",
    "New late arrivals and old saves reconstruct the inspected original role setup. Existing saved journals rebind to live roster records; offline old-save guests follow subsequent role switches before reconnect.",
    "Work runs on party operations, deployment and progress snapshots, outside per-actor tick loops. No performance gain is claimed."
  ],
